.Dd $Mdocdate$
.Dt EGGHEAD-LLM 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm egghead-llm
.Nd manage LLM providers
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm egghead llm
.Op Cm list | add | remove Ar name | test | models
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Cm llm
manages the
.Sy llm:
section of
.Pa ~/.config/egghead/config.yml .
.Nm
supports multiple providers concurrently; each provider supplies an
API key (or references one through
.Sy {env:VAR} )
and contributes its models to the catalog.
.Pp
Out of the box,
.Nm
ships presets for Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, xAI, Groq, DeepSeek,
Mistral, OpenRouter, Ollama, and LM Studio, plus a generic
OpenAI-compatible endpoint. Provider API keys are auto-detected from
the environment at startup
.Pq Ev ANTHROPIC_API_KEY , Ev OPENAI_API_KEY , Ev GOOGLE_API_KEY , and so on ;
the configuration file is for persistent, considered choices,
the environment is for credentials.
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width "remove name"
.It Cm list
Show configured providers and their key status. The default when no
subcommand is given.
.It Cm add
Walk through adding a provider interactively. Picks the provider,
prompts for the key (or env-ref), and verifies it with a small request.
.It Cm remove Ar name
Remove the named provider from the configuration.
.It Cm test
Verify each configured provider can connect.
.It Cm models
List every model each provider reports, with context-window sizes.
.El
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "--config path"
.It Fl -config Ar path
Override the configuration file location.
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show help.
.El
.Sh CONFIGURATION
The
.Sy llm:
section is a list of provider entries:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
llm:
  - provider: anthropic
    api_key: "{env:ANTHROPIC_API_KEY}"

  - provider: openai
    api_key: "{env:OPENAI_API_KEY}"

  - provider: openai
    name: together
    base_url: https://api.together.xyz/v1
    api_key: "{env:TOGETHER_API_KEY}"
.Ed
.Pp
.Sy name:
distinguishes a custom entry from a default of the same provider, and
.Sy base_url:
opts into an OpenAI-compatible endpoint other than the provider's own.
The
.Sy {env:VAR}
substitution lets you keep the configuration file under version
control without committing keys.
.Sh EXAMPLES
Add a provider:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
egghead llm add
.Ed
.Pp
Inspect the model catalog:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
egghead llm models
.Ed
.Pp
Verify everything is reachable:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
egghead llm test
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr egghead-init 1 ,
.Xr egghead-config 1 ,
.Xr egghead-doctor 1 ,
.Xr egghead 1 ,
.Xr egghead 5
